{
  "id": 236541093,
  "iid": 11422,
  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "Fix crash on DICOM Export Objects window close [#19207]",
  "description": "Payload data for DICOM export object is allocated at the file scope:\n\nhttps://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/blob/master/epan/dissectors/packet-dcm.c#L1365\n\n`pdv_combined = (guint8 *)wmem_alloc0(wmem_file_scope(), dcm_header_len + pdv_combined_len);`\n\nthen copied as a raw pointer to export object payload:\n\nhttps://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/blob/master/epan/dissectors/packet-dcm.c#L1390\n\n`eo_info->payload_data = pdv_combined;`\n\nFree is called on Export Objects window close, which crashes Wireshark:\n\nhttps://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/blob/master/epan/export_object.c#L154\n\n`g_free(entry->payload_data);`\n\n Copying dissector's payload for the Export Objects window fixes the issue.",
  "state": "merged",
  "created_at": "2023-07-14T12:44:24.202Z",
  "updated_at": "2023-07-14T14:32:51.360Z",
